DJD5 sub n4 diode_nd2ps_06v0 area=1.8e-12 pj=2.036e-05
DJS5 sub n5 diode_nd2ps_06v0 area=1.8e-12 pj=2.036e-05
XM6 n5 n5 n6 sub nfet_05v0 w=1e-05 l=6e-07 ad=1.8e-12 as=1.8e-12 pd=2.036e-05 ps=2.036e-05
DJD6 sub n5 diode_nd2ps_06v0 area=1.8e-12 pj=2.036e-05
DJS6 sub n6 diode_nd2ps_06v0 area=1.8e-12 pj=2.036e-05
