XM8 n7 n7 n8 sub nfet_05v0 w=1e-05 l=6e-07 ad=1.8e-12 as=1.8e-12 pd=2.036e-05 ps=2.036e-05
DJD8 sub n7 diode_nd2ps_06v0 area=1.8e-12 pj=2.036e-05
DJS8 sub n8 diode_nd2ps_06v0 area=1.8e-12 pj=2.036e-05
XM9 n8 n8 n9 sub nfet_05v0 w=1e-05 l=6e-07 ad=1.8e-12 as=1.8e-12 pd=2.036e-05 ps=2.036e-05
